  The source pin was checked in <verbatim|source/upstream.json>. The shared
  literature notes were searched for the prior terms <verbatim|Wilson>,
  <verbatim|atlas>, <verbatim|Schur>, <verbatim|kernel>, <verbatim|strip>,
  <verbatim|Laurent>, and <verbatim|RG>; the relevant found note did not
  cover these component estimates. No external result is substituted for the
  local source argument, so no web or primary-literature search was needed.
  No Lean or LaTeX build has been run for this unit. The required command
  <verbatim|python3 scripts/check_blueprint.py> was run and exited 1 because
  this isolated output directory has no <verbatim|blueprint/units/YM-000026/unit.json>;
  adding shared unit metadata is outside the assigned outputs.

